<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21092] Make lgssc an internal key type</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21092</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Keys of the lgssc type, used by the GSS keyring, are only meant to be requested by the kernel when it needs a new GSS context. The upcall started for them, lgss_keyring, then negotiates the context based on the callout info the kernel builds.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;lgssc is currently registered as a regular key type. The proposed change is to prefix its name with a dot, so that the keys subsystem handles it as an internal key type.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
